NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000958 "=head1 CONTRIBUTING"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000959 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000960 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000961 "To contribute, you can send patches by email/via RT, or send pull requests on"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000962 "GitHub."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000963 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000964 "Most of the time, you don't need to build the distribution yourself. You can"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000965 "simply modify the code, then test via:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000966 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000967 " % prove -l"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000968 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000969 "If you want to build the distribution (e.g. to try to install it locally on your"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000970 "system), you can install L<Dist::Zilla>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000971 "L<Dist::Zilla::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000972 "L<Pod::Weaver::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>, and sometimes one or two other"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000973 "Dist::Zilla- and/or Pod::Weaver plugins. Any additional steps required beyond"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000974 "that are considered a bug and can be reported to me."
